26-10-13","lean":"nonpartisan"},{"who":"Tim Seaman","what":"Co-moderated the Nexstar Iowa Senate debate between Hinson and Turek.","when":"2026-10-13","lean":"nonpartisan"},{"who":"Karl Rove","what":"Predicted Republican Ashley Hinson will win.","when":"2026-10-20","lean":"R"}],"donorSignal":{"z":0.281,"parts":{"instate":-0.368,"breadth":0.423,"small":0.961,"reach":0.108},"shift_logit":0.0,"applies":false},"research":{"summary":"WOWT reports the open seat race to replace retiring Sen. Joni Ernst has tightened, with recent polls split between Republican Rep. Ashley Hinson and Democratic state Rep. Josh Turek. Coverage centers on rising costs, tariffs and the Iran war, Medicaid cuts in the One Big Beautiful Bill Act, Hinson's family wealth and Turek's missed legislative votes.","issues":[{"issue":"Cost of living","why":"Hinson says Iowans have been priced out of the American dream while Turek ties higher costs to tariffs and the Iran war.","src":"https://www.wowt.com/2026/10/22/iowa-senate-race-tightens-with-less-than-two-weeks-election-day/"},{"issue":"Medicaid and rural health care","why":"Clinic closures like MercyOne in Ottumwa feed a fight over Medicaid cuts in the One Big Beautiful Bill Act, which Hinson backed.","src":"https://www.iowapublicradio.org/political-news/2026-10-12/senate-hinson-turek-healthcare-election"},{"issue":"Tariffs and farmers","why":"Turek says Hinson voted five times for tariffs that hurt farm communities, and Hinson calls a plan to raise beef imports a bad idea for Iowa farmers.","src":"https://iowacapitaldispatch.com/2026/10/07/turek-hinson-talk-legislative-track-records-at-us-senate-debate/"},{"issue":"Iran war and fuel prices","why":"Turek links the war to diesel and fertilizer costs and backs a war powers resolution, while Hinson opposes it but wants an orderly end.","src":"https://www.kwwl.com/news/decision-2026-hinson-and-turek-meet-in-the-final-iowa-senate-debate/article_81ab81a9-6f8f-40ba-90aa-5d34cc7b48fa.html"},{"issue":"Water quality","why":"Both candidates were asked about nitrates and cancer concerns, with Hinson stressing infrastructure and Turek favoring conservation incentives over mandates.","src":"https://www.kwwl.com/news/decision-2026-hinson-and-turek-meet-in-the-final-iowa-senate-debate/article_81ab81a9-6f8f-40ba-90aa-5d34cc7b48fa.html"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Fact check faults wealth ad against Hinson","date":"2026-10-23","what":"PolitiFact rated Mostly False a WinSenate ad saying Hinson is 8 million dollars richer after five years in Congress, finding the gain was closer to 4 million and mostly from her husband's business sale.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://politifact.com/factchecks/2026/oct/23/winsenate/ashley-hinson-8-million-richer-iowa-senate"},{"title":"Trump rallies with Hinson in Sioux City","date":"2026-10-22","what":"Trump called Turek a woke far left radical at a Sioux City rally, while Hinson now bills herself as a bipartisan fighter who pushes back on him over beef imports and Russian diesel.","helps":"mixed","kind":"rally","src":"https://www.cbsnews.com/minnesota/news/iowa-senate-race-hinson-trump-sioux-city-rally/"},{"title":"Gazette editorial board backs Turek","date":"2026-10-21","what":"The Cedar Rapids Gazette editorial board endorsed Turek, citing his opposition to Medicaid cuts and arguing Hinson aligned too closely with Trump on tariffs and Iran.","helps":"D","kind":"endorsement","src":"https://turek4iowa.com/news/icymi-the-gazettes-editorial-board-iowa-should-send-josh-turek-to-the-u-s-senate/"},{"title":"Ernst campaigns with Hinson in Glenwood","date":"2026-10-21","what":"Retiring Sen. Joni Ernst joined Hinson in southwest Iowa as an analyst said spending is on pace for a state record and polls show no clear leader.","helps":"R","kind":"rally","src":"https://www.wowt.com/2026/10/22/iowa-senate-race-tightens-with-less-than-two-weeks-election-day/"},{"title":"Final debate at WHO 13","date":"2026-10-13","what":"Hinson said Turek showed up for 42 percent of House votes this year, which PolitiFact found accurate, while Turek called her husband a shadow lobbyist, a claim PolitiFact called misleading.","helps":"R","kind":"debate","src":"https://politifact.com/article/2026/oct/14/hinson-turek-iowa-senate-farm-bill-shadow-lobbyist/"},{"title":"First debate on Iowa Press","date":"2026-10-07","what":"Turek attacked Hinson's per diem use and votes on tariffs and the Iran war, and Hinson said Turek was lying about her family's wealth and should refund his own per diem.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://iowacapitaldispatch.com/2026/10/07/turek-hinson-talk-legislative-track-records-at-us-senate-debate/"},{"title":"Pro Turek PAC hits Hinson on donors","date":"2026-10-05","what":"Government Works PAC aired an ad accusing Hinson of putting special interests and donors ahead of Iowans and skipping chances to face constituents.","helps":"D","kind":"ad","src":"https://iowastartingline.com/news/politics/video/new-ad-from-pro-turek-pac-takes-a-swing-at-politicians-not-showing-up-in-iowa/"},{"title":"Marist poll shows Turek up 8","date":"2026-09-20","what":"A Marist survey of registered voters had Turek at 50 percent to Hinson's 42, while an Emerson poll weeks earlier had Hinson ahead by 5.","helps":"D","kind":"national","src":"https://www.fox9.com/news/iowa-2026-senate-josh-turek-ashley-hinson"}],"events":[{"title":"Missed votes attack","prompt":"Records show the Democrat missed most Iowa House floor votes this year while campaigning, and the Republican is hammering it in debates. How does the campaign handle attendance?","issue":"other","src":"https://politifact.com/article/2026/oct/14/hinson-turek-iowa-senate-farm-bill-shadow-lobbyist/","opts":[{"label":"Own it, pivot to results","say":"Admit the absences and point to a bipartisan effectiveness ranking and bills passed.","pos":-0.3,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Counter on Hinson's record","say":"Hit back on congressional per diem and committee absences